invariant: INV-36
file: srv_cfg.h
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: srv_cfg.h documents the ECDSA identity's private key by
  P256_PRIV_LEN, which only p256_sign.h defines and no public header
  includes, so a consumer reads a length it cannot name. colibri met the
  ticket key's length that way at 8a813e2. tools/public-constants.py
  finds the name in the header's comment and objects.

--- old
// p256_sign reads, and pub at the 64-byte uncompressed point X||Y that
--- new
// p256_sign.h calls P256_PRIV_LEN, and pub at the 64-byte uncompressed point X||Y that
